script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"마그네스!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Magnes
	"윽, 내가 무슨..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"왜 그래, 스바루?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"아, 아무것도 아니야...\n잠깐 몸이 이상하게 느껴졌는데\n지금은 괜찮아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그보다...\n또 카드 하나가\n떨어졌어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Magnes
	"「노이즈 카드」라고 해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"나를 폭주하게 만든\n두 사람이 그렇게\n부르더라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"두 사람이라...\n에이스가 「위험한 녀석들」이라고\n했던 사람들이 아닐까?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"노이즈 카드...\n위험한 녀석들..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아무래도 긴장을 늦추면\n안 되겠구나, 꼬마야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Magnes
	"아무튼!\n구해 줘서 정말\n고마워!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 수습할 시간이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사이언스 클럽의\n꿈이 이뤄지도록 내가\n힘쓸게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"역시 최고야, 마그네스!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Magnes
	"맞아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"트랜스 아웃할 시간이야, 스바루!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"알았어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
